Kount P5 — a "New item" link opens the organisation vault's add dialog prefilled.

`#/organizations/<org>/vault?collectionId=<id>&action=add&name=…&username=…&uri=…` opens the New item
dialog for a Login, in that collection, with the name, the username and the URI filled. Only those
three values are read (never a password); a `uri` that is not http(s) is dropped; each value is
trimmed and capped at 1000 characters. Applies to vaultwarden/vw_web_builds at the commit in
upstream.lock (build/apply.sh checks it; build/web-vault.Dockerfile applies it).

